      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُعْفٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَعْفٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ ضُعْفٍ</span> in the Kur
xxx. 53 means <i>Of sperm.</i> (O, K, TA.) AA,
reciting before the Prophet, said <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ ضَعْفٍ</span>; and
was told by the latter to say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">من ضُعْفٍ</span>, [i. e.]
with damm. (TA.)

